# Prettier 3 reads .gitignore as well as this file, and only from the directory
# it runs in. Prettier is root-only here (see CLAUDE.md), so this pair is the
# whole story: the root .gitignore already covers node_modules, build, dist and
# coverage. The lockfile is the exception — it is tracked, so .gitignore does
# not list it, but it is generated and must not be reformatted.
package-lock.json
